<title>CYPRUS: Av. yield on Cyprus repo auction down to 4.70 pct.</title>
<headline>Av. yield on Cyprus repo auction down to 4.70 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on a t-bill auction held under repurchase agreement between the Central Bank of Cyprus and commercial banks was 4.70 percent on Wednesday, down from 4.87 percent at the last auction held on June 27, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Yields on the 39.3 million pounds worth ($76 million) of bills sold ranged from 4.45 percent to 4.90 percent. ($=0.516 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 469625</p>
</text>
